  "summary_md": "**bAIwor ([@web3myid](https://x.com/web3myid/status/2115933790493348065))** built **bAIwor Code**, a terminal coding agent with four rotating Javanese Punakawan personas by tool (architect, explorer, builder, auditor), made with MiniMax Code and M3.1 Flash's 1M context; guardrails include a symlink-aware sandbox, approval gates, fenced untrusted tool output, secret redaction and read-only MCP by default ([bAIwor/baiworcode](https://github.com/bAIwor/baiworcode)).",
